### Completed
- Read `skills/AGENT.md`, `skills/client-side-skill.md`, `skills/server-side-skill.md`; confirmed `/profile` redirects to `/account` (duplicate route).
- Logged into `https://account.ui.com/login` as Account A through MFA; authenticated session active in page 1.
