Open-redirect sinks are consistently gated by `AC()` (http/https + registrable domain in ui.com/ubnt.com/uisp.com). Let me enumerate the SPA's API path constants to find any untested IDOR/BAC-capable endpoints.
[0m$ [0mcd result/client-side/account.ui.com/login/javascript
python3 - <<'PY'
import re
s=open('index-BAUIMHQa.js',encoding='utf-8',errors='replace').read()
# find paths:{ ... } blocks (brace match, bounded)
out=[]
for m in re.finditer(r'paths:\{', s):
    i=m.end(); depth=1; j=i
    while j<len(s) and depth>0 and j-i<4000:
        c=s[j]
        if c=='{': depth+=1
        elif c=='}': depth-=1
        j+=1
    block=s[m.start():j]
    if len(block)<4000:
        out.append((m.start(),block))
seen=set()
for off,b in out:
    key=b[:2000]
    if key in seen: continue
    seen.add(key)
    print(f"\n--- @{off} ---\n{b}")
PY
